## 1. Foundations

### Grid & Spacing

| Token | Value | Usage |
|-------|-------|-------|
| `--spacing-1` | 8px | Base unit |
| `--spacing-2` | 16px | Card padding, field gap |
| `--spacing-3` | 24px | Section gap, gutter |
| `--spacing-4` | 32px | Large section gap |

All spacing and sizes are multiples of **8px**. Never use arbitrary pixel values.

### Color Palette

#### Base Roles

| Role | Token | Value | Notes |
|------|-------|-------|-------|
| Background | `--color-background` | `#______` | Main app background |
| Surface | `--color-surface` | `rgba(…)` | Card / panel background |
| Border | `--color-border` | `rgba(…)` | Default dividers |
| Text Primary | `--color-text-primary` | `#______` | Headings, labels |
| Text Secondary | `--color-text-secondary` | `#______` | Descriptions, captions |

#### Semantic / Type Colors

> Each type color must have equal perceived brightness (APCA / WCAG AA minimum).

| Name | Token | Value |
|------|-------|-------|
