## 2. Components

### {{ComponentName}}

**Anatomy:**
- Background: `--color-surface` + `backdrop-filter: blur(10px)`
- Border: `--border-width-default` solid; color = semantic type color
- Icon: 20×20px, top-left, color = semantic type color
- Title: 14px / 600
- Description: 12px / 400 / line-height 1.4
- Padding: `--spacing-2` (16px) all sides

**States:**

| State | Visual Change |
|-------|---------------|
| Default | - |
| Hover | border opacity ↑, bg opacity → 0.15; connected edges → opacity 0.8 |
| Active / Selected | border → `--border-width-selected`; unrelated nodes → opacity 0.3 |
| Disabled | opacity 0.4, pointer-events: none |

---

## 3. Interactions

| Interaction | Behavior |
|-------------|----------|
| Default transition | `150ms ease-in-out` for opacity and border changes |
| Hover | border brighter, background opacity +0.10 |
| Selected | border 2px; non-connected elements dim to opacity 0.3 |
| Zoom < 50% | Hide text labels; show only icons and colored borders |

