## 5. Design Tokens

Define all tokens in `src/styles/tokens.css` (or equivalent). Raw literals must not appear in component styles.

```css
:root {
  /* Spacing */
  --spacing-1: 8px;
  --spacing-2: 16px;
  --spacing-3: 24px;
  --spacing-4: 32px;

  /* Colors - Base */
  --color-background: #121417;
  --color-surface: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
  --color-border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
  --color-text-primary: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
  --color-text-secondary: #A0A0A0;

  /* Colors - Semantic Types */
  /* --color-type-concept: #4CC9F0; */

  /* Shape */
  --radius-card: 12px;
  --radius-chip: 6px;
  --border-width-default: 1px;
  --border-width-selected: 2px;
}
```

